      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mantador%2C_North_Dakota"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The depot was placed under the 'Long Length Law,' which required nine-mile intervals to supply trains and settlers.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        2
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mantador%2C_North_Dakota"
    },
    {
